{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multiprofile multimodal setup using pca_n2000 and resnet50 encoders with avgpool aggregation, comparing it to the concat fusion baseline (config_018). Validation accuracy of 0.6390 slightly outperforms the concat baseline (0.6186), with validation F1 of 0.6197 supporting this trend. The relative contribution of weighted fusion versus other design choices remains uncertain without further isolation of variables."
}

